    "causal_summary": "`cli-pi` is registered as the hub's 6th executor and its model/MCP-host integration are real and live-verified (phases 007/009), but Pi still cannot actually run this repo's 36 commands, 13 agents, or governance hooks the way Claude Code/OpenCode/Codex/Cursor/Devin already can — phases 005/006/008 designed HOW each would translate but explicitly stopped short of writing the files (`.pi/prompts/`, `.pi/agents/`, `.pi/extensions/` all do not exist in this worktree today; only `.pi/mcp.json`/`.pi/settings.json`/`.pi/npm/` exist, from phase 007)",
